# Dashboard Customization Verification

- [ ] Navigate to http://localhost:3000/
- [ ] Check for "Customise" button in header
- [ ] Click "Customise"
- [ ] Verify "Remove" (X) buttons and drag handles on widgets
- [ ] Click "Add New Widget"
- [ ] Verify widget picker modal appears
- [ ] Close picker
- [ ] Click "Save Layout"
- [ ] Take screenshot of dashboard
- [ ] Return report
